{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50506","headline":"山名 · 王勔","name":"山名","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丽景斜中峤，晴华泛晚春。\n琴声抽楚雪，歌曲下梁尘。\n倾盖雕炎远，班荆密契新。\n方承绮□暮，烟上洛桥□。\n（见影印本《新编纂图书类要事林广记》卷七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}